A '''Party Gift''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Gift]] item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Party Gifts''' can be obtained by killing [[Winter Sea Creatures]] or participating in the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event while {{NPCSprite|Foxy}} is mayor or minister with the {{Green|A Time for Giving}} perk.
